      tauri-commands contract.
    - §6.2 sync-menubar command + allow-list documented.
    - §7 over-broad "every JS-callable command" claim refined into an
      enumerated table of command groups with runtime checks.
    - AUDIT.md rows updated for window / menubar / finder commands.
    
