    - `cargo check --manifest-path apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml` — pass.
    - `cargo test ... window::` — 2 new tests pass.
    - `cargo test ... menubar::` — 2 new tests pass (4 total in module).
    - `pnpm --filter desktop build` — pass.
    
